{"2882040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VISEGUNNE", "steam_appid": 2882040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/f0d67afeed9a1f6be4a167a009956b73.apng?t=1779501552\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/f0d67afeed9a1f6be4a167a009956b73.poster.avif?t=1779501552\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"ABOUT: SOUL-CAPABLE PILOT FIELD GUIDE\" width=616 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VISEGUNNE is a story-driven shoot 'em up where explosive action unfolds around you: cities are leveled, space colonies collapse, and orbital structures crumble catastrophically. Between missions, engage with characters who react to the memories you've accumulated, even passing gossip around as they attempt to make sense of the conflict. Set in an era where the human soul is harnessed as a power source, join the DIVINITY SPACE DEFENSE CORPORATION's elite mercenaries in a war against pro-Earth terrorists threatening the fragile peace of space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/35e1054e36840d25b88cbf2fa8a1a942.poster.avif?t=1779501552\" aria-label=\"An airborne mech shoots at a robot that fires back as the robot&#039;s platform collapses under its feet. Fire and collapsing strutures can be seen in the background.\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/35e1054e36840d25b88cbf2fa8a1a942.webm?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/35e1054e36840d25b88cbf2fa8a1a942.mp4?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/7fc8640da9ae6d3bb569b6a07adc69d7.apng?t=1779501552\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/7fc8640da9ae6d3bb569b6a07adc69d7.poster.avif?t=1779501552\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"KEY FEATURES: DATA ANALYSIS SUMMARY\" width=616 height=128 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven shoot ’em up set in a world ruled by propaganda, global conflict, and competing visions for the soul of humanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular visual effects and explosive set-pieces in a handcrafted pixel-art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choreographed enemy waves and bosses brought to life with painstakingly detailed animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with characters between missions who remember your conversations and relationships. Camaraderie, gossip, truth, and lies quietly shape future interactions and reveal deeper character insights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DUAL MULTIPLIER scoring system that rewards strategic use of primary and secondary weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, steal, and upgrade a wide array of weapons, each with distinct strategies and attack styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pumping soundtrack featuring over 2 hours of original music with an old-school flair inspired by the late 1980s and early 1990s CD-ROM era.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/2f70a617b9176a3b446a48fd8d870835.poster.avif?t=1779501552\" aria-label=\"An ornate cockpit bootup sequence with lights flashing dramatically.\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/2f70a617b9176a3b446a48fd8d870835.webm?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/2f70a617b9176a3b446a48fd8d870835.mp4?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/41110a8b123379e1192e40ab227cd82b.apng?t=1779501552\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/41110a8b123379e1192e40ab227cd82b.poster.avif?t=1779501552\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"STORY: MISSION BRIEFING\" width=616 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/6fee3705d895eb1060c735bdddff317a.poster.avif?t=1779501552\" aria-label=\"An airborne mech shoots down two transport carrier ships as a large column falls in the background.\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/6fee3705d895eb1060c735bdddff317a.webm?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/6fee3705d895eb1060c735bdddff317a.mp4?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When scientists discover evidence of the human soul, long-dormant divides among the nations of Earth erupt into global war. Colonists residing off-world avoid the bloodshed, but live in fear that the planet's conflicts might soon spill into space. With no formal military of their own, each colony resorts to employing mercenaries and privateers for their protection. The most influential of these firms is the DIVINITY SPACE DEFENSE CORPORATION, utilizing top-secret war machines capable of harnessing a user's spirit as an endless source of energy. These SOUL-CAPABLE combat vehicles are unmatched in battle, and after a century of this order, DIVINITY has grown to dominate colonial affairs, effectively quarantining Earth's wars and its toxic politics to the planet's surface.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, pro-Earth fanatics threaten the peace of space, demanding an end to DIVINITY's policy of segregation. Spurred on by the illegal broadcasts of an enigmatic android holy-man calling himself Kourosh, these dissidents have seized control of a colony and are demanding an end to DIVINITY's blockade of the planet. As SOUL-CAPABLE pilot End Visegunne, your squad's mission is to eliminate these terrorists, dismantle their network of co-conspirators, and return peace to the colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/2af9b39932b7b9bb643bf9079722e74a.poster.avif?t=1779501552\" aria-label=\"An airborne mech shoots an attack boat as a rainy ocean speeds by. The boat flips as waves rush by.\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/2af9b39932b7b9bb643bf9079722e74a.webm?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/2af9b39932b7b9bb643bf9079722e74a.mp4?t=1779501552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882040/extras/091d2d420267024ca409c58e0abf37fc.pos